    "%@ %@ · %@ failed · %@ freed" : {
      "comment" : "A summary of the trash action, including the number of items that were deleted, the number of items that couldn't be deleted, and the total size of the deleted items. The first argument is the number of items that were successfully deleted. The second argument is the number of items that couldn't be deleted. The third argument is the total size of the deleted items.",
